# L §5.6 Bindings: "Binds are read left to right: each bind's where may read the binds before it, and each
# where filters at its own bind (c in brackets where pos(c) == pos(b) + 1)."  Over brackets [a, b, c] the
# pairs (b, c) with c the next bracket after b are (a, b) and (b, c): 2 tuples.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

index brackets = [x1, x2, x3]

ask q1: count(b in brackets, c in brackets where pos(c) == pos(b) + 1)
=== expect
q1: 2
  cut 2026-01-01
